    },
    {
      "id": "72:p1",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:19272:19274"
    },
    {
      "id": "72:p2",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "原来那套螺丝刀是用在这里的！你回工作台取来了螺丝刀，把录像机翻到背面。你尝试拆解录像机取出磁带。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:19274:19324"
    },
    {
      "id": "72:p3",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "进行一次机械维修检定。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:19324:19337"
    },
    {
      "id": "72:p4",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "如果检定成功，转到 73。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:19337:19352"
    },
    {
      "id": "72:p5",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "如果检定失败，转到 74。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:19352:19367"
    },
    {
      "id": "72:p6",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "如果检定失败，而你希望孤注一掷，你可以进行第二次检定；后果是伤到你自己和磁带：\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:19367:19408"
    },
    {
      "id": "72:p7",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "如果孤注一掷成功，转到 73。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:19408:19425"
    },
    {
      "id": "72:p8",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "如果孤注一掷失败，转到 75。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:19425:19442"
    }
  ]
}
